WEBVTT

00:11:00.626 --> 00:11:02.187
I felt loved.

00:11:03.123 --> 00:11:06.619
It was one of the most surreal things
I have experienced.

00:11:06.643 --> 00:11:10.736
In a time in which I should have
felt abandoned by God,

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:13.054
I was not reduced to ashes.

00:11:13.598 --> 00:11:15.943
I felt like I was floating,

00:11:15.967 --> 00:11:17.731
floating on the love and prayers

00:11:17.755 --> 00:11:21.016
of all those who hummed
around me like worker bees,

00:11:21.040 --> 00:11:23.837
bringing me notes and socks and flowers

00:11:23.861 --> 00:11:27.100
and quilts embroidered
with words of encouragement.

00:11:27.707 --> 00:11:29.879
But when they sat beside me,

00:11:29.903 --> 00:11:31.826
my hand in their hands,